# Git commits

When creating git commits in this project:

- NEVER add a `Co-authored-by:` trailer for anyone other than the user.
- NEVER add any co-author or contributor credit lines to commit messages.
- Commits must be authored only by the user — use a plain commit message with no co-author lines.
- Only create commits when the user explicitly asks.

This keeps credit on me instead of Cursor.
